Don't save more than 1 or 2.  Dead characters can't use wishes.  You'll
get another /oW at the castle, which you're more likely to reach if you
use your wishes.  Speed boots, gauntlets, 3 b?oGeno, archon figurine,
b+oID, "oLS... any of these are good wishes IMHO.  Maybe save 1 wish
for a "oR or BoH (head for Sokoban now, and use this wish when you
arrive at the last level), and maybe save the wrested charge.  One
thing I wouldn't bother with now is a marker, since you probably don't
know many scrolls.

